      "sha": "6ac8b78b9d05f34419d885522a6cdd5bbbfe7f27",
      "message": "refactor: clarify variable names in diagnostic processing loop\n\nRename ambiguous single-letter and overloaded names in main's\ncompiler-message loop to reflect their domain meaning:\n- msg -> cargo_record (the whole cargo JSON record)\n- message -> diagnostic (the inner rustc diagnostic)\n- msg_text -> diagnostic_message\n- s / span_obj -> span / primary_span\n- line_str -> line\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
