    {
      "sha": "a389502ba5aa22dc56c1025f09177929669cbb51",
      "message": "docs: document core lint module traits and public API\n\nAdd module-level documentation to the soroban_cost_lints crate and\ndocstrings to every public item and trait implementation:\n\n- Crate-level overview covering what each lint detects, the shared\n  declare_lint!/marker-struct/LateLintPass shape, and how to add a lint.\n- Docs for LintCategory (and its variants), LintMetadata, LINT_METADATA,\n  and the register_lints entry point.\n- Docs for each lint-pass marker struct and its LateLintPass::check_expr\n  method describing the pattern matched and the guards applied.\n- Docs for the Visitor trait impls (BindingCollector, LocalReadCollector).\n\nExamples are omitted from doc comments so no doctests are introduced;\nintra-doc links reference only in-crate items.\n\nCloses #213\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
